FastMCP TypeScript ReptilianHQ repack

This product includes software developed by PrefectHQ and FastMCP contributors:
https://github.com/PrefectHQ/fastmcp-ts

Based on upstream FastMCP 1.9.0, commit
b8d1e365b3352fb868e6b6b2678a5f5fe4e850a8.

ReptilianHQ modifications include inherited-key rejection in static token
verification, HTTP session recovery without replaying failed operations,
and verification-availability response handling.

Sources and modifications:
https://github.com/ReptilianHQ/fastmcp-ts
